    "summary": "With **TYRANIDS** as your Army Faction, any of your **TYRANIDS** units within 6\" of at least 1 friendly **SYNAPSE** model counts as in Synapse Range of both that model and your army. While in your army's Synapse Range, the unit:\n\n- rolls 3D6 rather than 2D6 for Battle-shock tests\n- gets +1 Strength on its models' melee attacks",
